 used)               GCOUNT  =                    1 / group count (not used)                         INHERIT =                    T / inherit the primary header                     EXTNAME = 'APERTURE'           / name of extension                              EXTVER  =                    1 / extension version number (not format version)  TELESCOP= 'Kepler  '           / telescope                                      INSTRUME= 'Kepler Photometer'  / detector type                                  OBJECT  = 'KIC 9512981'        / string version of target id                    KEPLERID=              9512981 / unique Kepler target identifier                RADESYS = 'ICRS    '           / reference frame of celestial coordinates       RA_OBJ  =           284.849890 / [deg] right ascension                          DEC_OBJ =            46.138950 / [deg] declination                              EQUINOX =               2000.0 / equinox of celestial coordinate system         WCSAXES =                    2 / number of WCS axes                             CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN'           / right ascension coordinate type                CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN'           / declination coordinate type                    CRPIX1  =   3.4380767994895223 / [pixel] reference pixel along image axis 1     CRPIX2  =   2.4927037598235984 / [pixel] reference pixel along image axis 2     CRVAL1  =   284.84989049999996 / [deg] right ascension at reference pixel       CRVAL2  =             46.13895 / [deg] declination at reference pixel           CUNIT1  = 'deg     '           / physical unit in column dimension              CUNIT2  = 'deg     '           / physical unit in row dimension                 CDELT1  =   -0.001105748968366 / [deg] pixel scale in RA dimension              CDELT2  =    0.001105748968366 / [deg] pixel scale in Dec dimension             PC1_1   =   -0.604044682609425 / linear transformation element cos(th)          PC1_2   =   0.7985068123047278 / linear transformation elem